                        Boston, Houghton Mifflin Company, 1960.</item>
                    <item> Eisenhower, <hi rendition="#italic">Mandate for Change</hi>: Dwight D.
                        Eisenhower, <hi rendition="#italic">Mandate for Change, 1953–1956</hi>, New
                        York, Doubleday &amp; Company, Inc., 1963.</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">H. C. Debs.</hi>, 5th series: <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Parliamentary Debates, House of Commons, Fifth
                            Series.</hi> Ismay, <hi rendition="#italic">NATO</hi>: Lord Ismay, <hi
