                        Institute of International Affairs, London, Oxford University Press,
                        1955.</item>
                    <item> Spaak, <hi rendition="#italic">The Continuing Battle</hi>: Paul-Henri
                        Spaak, <hi rendition="#italic">The Continuing Battle, Memoirs of a European,
                            1936–1966</hi>, London, 1971.</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">10th Report on Germany: Tenth Quarterly Report on
